{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration/recovery policy in specifications. The policy gives one primary controllable per decision state, keeps all states total on uncontrollable sensor events, treats obstacle events as safety-critical preemptions, uses backward motion only in dedicated front-obstacle recovery, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort stuck state after repeated front blockage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensor outcomes from motion capabilities in G so E can impose safe one-action decisions.",
    "Bias clear-space behavior toward move_forward, use random_walk only as a secondary exploration mode, prefer short directed turns for side/front obstacles, and use full_rotate only after repeated failed front recovery."
  ],
